     <para>The=20
     <quote>x1 ... x5</quote> indicates that=20
     <quote>klama</quote> is a five-place predicate, and show the natural o=
rder (as assigned by the language engineers) of those places: agent, destin=
ation, origin, route, means.</para>
     <para>The place structures of brivla are not absolutely stable aspects=
